PewterCity_Gym_Text_GymSign::
    .string "CLOUDBURST CITY POKéMON GYM\n"
    .string "Leader: RAINA\p"
    .string "The Storm-Front Meteorologist!$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_GymGuide::
    .string "Yo! Champ in the making!\p"
    .string "This Gym studies what happens when\n"
    .string "Pokémon battle in heavy RAIN!\p"
    .string "Rain makes WATER moves stronger and\n"
    .string "FIRE moves weaker.\p"
    .string "Around here, it does something else\n"
    .string "too—ELECTRIC moves become more\l"
    .string "accurate!\p"
    .string "That's why you'll see both WATER and\n"
    .string "ELECTRIC Pokémon in this Gym.\p"
    .string "Don't just think about types.\n"
    .string "Think about the WEATHER!$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_WadeIntro::
PewterCity_Gym_Text_LiamIntro::
    .string "Rain isn't just water falling from\n"
    .string "the sky.\p"
    .string "Runoff, flooding, rising water\n"
    .string "levels... it all has to go\l"
    .string "somewhere.\p"
    .string "Marill and I study what happens when\n"
    .string "there's too much of it!$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_WadeDefeat::
PewterCity_Gym_Text_LiamDefeat::
    .string "That's one forecast I didn't account\n"
    .string "for!$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_WadePostBattle::
PewterCity_Gym_Text_LiamPostBattle::
    .string "Water hits harder in Rain.\p"
    .string "That's simple enough—but Raina will\n"
    .string "expect you to understand more than\l"
    .string "that.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_SkyeIntro::
    .string "You hear that thunder?\p"
    .string "Most people run inside when a storm\n"
    .string "gets serious.\p"
    .string "I run toward it!\p"
    .string "Let's see how you handle the\n"
    .string "ELECTRIC side of Rain!$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_SkyeDefeat::
    .string "Whoa! You weathered that just fine!$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_SkyePostBattle::
    .string "Rain isn't only good for Water\n"
    .string "Pokémon.\p"
    .string "Around here, Electric moves become\n"
    .string "more accurate too.\p"
    .string "Raina uses both sides of the storm.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_RainaIntro::
PewterCity_Gym_Text_BrockIntro::
    .string "So, you made it through Wade and\n"
    .string "Skye. Good!\p"
    .string "Then you've seen both halves of what\n"
    .string "Rain can do.\p"
    .string "Most Trainers look at bad weather\n"
    .string "and see a problem.\p"
    .string "I see changing conditions. New\n"
    .string "advantages. New risks. New\l"
    .string "possibilities!\p"
    .string "A good meteorologist doesn't control\n"
    .string "the weather. We understand it.\p"
    .string "And a good Trainer does the same\n"
    .string "thing.\p"
    .string "Come on! Let's see what you learned!\n"
    .string "{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_RainaDefeat::
PewterCity_Gym_Text_BrockDefeat::
    .string "Ha! Now THAT was a good storm!$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_RainaPostDefeat::
    .string "You didn't just survive the Rain.\n"
    .string "You adapted to it.\p"
    .string "That's exactly what I wanted to see.\p"
    .string "You've earned the Squall Badge!$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_RainaSquallBadgeExplain::
    .string "The Squall Badge proves you can keep\n"
    .string "your footing when the conditions\l"
    .string "change.\p"
    .string "It also lets you use Flash outside\n"
    .string "of battle.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_RainaWeatherBallReward::
    .string "And take this—TM12, Weather Ball.\p"
    .string "Weather Ball changes with the\n"
    .string "weather around it.\p"
    .string "Rain makes it Water-type, but that's\n"
    .string "only one possibility.\p"
    .string "Keep traveling and you'll discover\n"
    .string "just how many forms a battle can\l"
    .string "take.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_RainaFirstClearFinal::
    .string "Never assume the battlefield is\n"
    .string "going to stay the way you found it.\p"
    .string "Watch the sky. Watch your opponent.\n"
    .string "Then adapt.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_RainaPostClearRepeat::
PewterCity_Gym_Text_BrockPostBattle::
    .string "Still watching the weather?\p"
    .string "Good. Conditions change all the time.\n"
    .string "A smart Trainer changes with them.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_RainaRematchPrompt::
    .string "Back for another storm test?\p"
    .string "The conditions are perfect.\n"
    .string "Want to battle?$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_RainaRematchYes::
    .string "Good! Let's see how well you handle\n"
    .string "the Rain now!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_RainaRematchNo::
    .string "No problem. The storm will still be\n"
    .string "here when you're ready.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_RainaRematchWin::
    .string "There it is. You saw the storm for\n"
    .string "what it was.\p"
    .string "You didn't fight the conditions—you\n"
    .string "read them and used them.\p"
    .string "That's what separates a good Trainer\n"
    .string "from a great one.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_RainaRematchSpent::
    .string "Our rematch is settled for now.\p"
    .string "Challenge the Pokémon League again,\n"
    .string "and when you return, I'll be ready\l"
    .string "for another storm test.$"

PewterCity_Gym_Text_DontHaveRoomForThis::
    .string "You don't have room for this.$"
